# Sample/demo blog posts — these ship with the blog feature purely to
# demonstrate its formatting capabilities (mermaid diagrams, KaTeX math,
# function-plot graphs, code blocks, etc). They're not real posts, so
# they're kept out of what gets pushed. _template.md is NOT listed here
# on purpose — the blog loader always skips files starting with "_",
# so it's safe to keep tracked as a starting point for new posts.
src/content/blog/how-this-blog-works.md
src/content/blog/markdown-formatting-demo.md
